as a whole gathering of game

00:36:08.320 --> 00:36:09.100
developers.

00:36:09.100 --> 00:36:11.620
And honestly, if
you're there, I think

00:36:11.620 --> 00:36:14.860
the IGDA group, International
Game Developers Association,

00:36:14.860 --> 00:36:19.280
is always putting out
events to kind of cultivate

00:36:19.280 --> 00:36:22.780
a great community within
the developers in games.

00:36:22.780 --> 00:36:27.010
And finding a community to
plug into is actually not hard.

00:36:27.010 --> 00:36:28.515
You just have to--
it's just meeting

00:36:28.515 --> 00:36:30.640
