friend, to the next friend.

00:36:30.640 --> 00:36:34.030
And eventually, you'll be
having to be triple-booked,

00:36:34.030 --> 00:36:36.430
because you're part of so
many different communities.

00:36:36.430 --> 00:36:37.390
