00:36:43.600 --> 00:36:44.170
It was all fine.

00:36:44.170 --> 00:36:44.961
We had a good time.

00:36:44.961 --> 00:36:45.700
It was great.

00:36:45.700 --> 00:36:47.874
Next year, Sherol joins Google.

00:36:47.874 --> 00:36:48.540
And I was like--

00:36:48.540 --> 00:36:49.426
SHEROL CHEN: We actually--
wait, wait, wait.

00:36:49.426 --> 00:36:49.870
MARK MANDEL: --oh,
we're going to do GDC.

00:36:49.870 --> 00:36:51.910
SHEROL CHEN: We actually
met at that booth, right?

00:36:51.910 --> 00:36:53.040
MARK MANDEL: We did meet
at a booth that year.

00:36:53.040 --> 00:36:53.410
SHEROL CHEN: We had met--

00:36:53.410 --> 00:36:54.340
MARK MANDEL: It was
before you joined.

00:36:54.340 --> 00:36:55.881
