00:37:12.640 --> 00:37:13.480
MARK MANDEL: That's true.

00:37:13.480 --> 00:37:14.021
That is true.

00:37:14.021 --> 00:37:14.950
That is true.

00:37:14.950 --> 00:37:15.610
Anyway, yeah.

